---
import "../styles/global.css";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Callout from "../components/Callout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About When to Visit Japan: Our Editorial Policy" description="Learn how When to Visit Japan researches weather, crowds, and costs — and read our editorial policy for honest, independent travel advice.">
  <section class="min-h-[100dvh]">
    <Nav />
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-accent-600 uppercase mb-4">About</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-zinc-900 mb-4 leading-none">Who's Behind This Guide</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed mb-12">The story behind the data, and how this guide is researched and maintained.</p>

      <PageHero image="/images/region-fuji.webp" alt="Mount Fuji with cherry blossoms in the foreground at sunrise" overlay="About" title="Data-driven Japan travel advice, researched and updated by our editorial team" />

      <!-- About this guide -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-4">About This Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          When to Visit Japan is written by travel researchers and independent writers. We combine climate data from the Japan Meteorological Agency, flight price tracking, Japan's official holiday calendar, and our own travel research to help you find the perfect time to visit.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
          We do not accept sponsored content or paid placements. Every recommendation is based on data and genuine travel experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Methodology -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6">How We Build Our Recommendations</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-2">Climate Data</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Temperature ranges and rain-day counts are based on Japan Meteorological Agency (JMA) historical climate patterns. Ranges shown are illustrative of typical conditions; for precise forecasts specific to your travel dates, please check local weather forecasts 2 weeks before your trip.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-2">Flight Prices</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Round-trip flight cost estimates are indicative figures based on <a href="https://www.google.com/travel/flights" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">Google Flights</a> search patterns for US departure cities. They show typical relative price differences between seasons rather than exact fares.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-2">Crowd Intelligence</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Crowd level estimates combine Japan's national holiday calendar with visitor statistics from the <a href="https://www.jnto.go.jp/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">Japan National Tourism Organization</a>. Peak periods are cross-checked against booking patterns and festival calendars.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-2">Editorial Process</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
              Our articles combine human editorial review with AI-assisted research and drafting. Seasonal narratives are fact-checked against official sources, festival calendars and pricing data before publication; where a region or season comes from data rather than personal experience, we say so.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Editorial Policy -->
      <Callout eyebrow="Editorial Policy" tone="neutral" class="mb-12" id="editorial-policy">
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-accent-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">1.</span> Every article is researched and edited by our team before publication. We aim for accuracy over speed, and we revise content when we find errors.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-accent-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">2.</span> Weather, price, and crowd data are reviewed at least once a year, and festival dates are updated annually against the Japanese national calendar.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-accent-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">3.</span> We do not accept payment for recommendations. No sponsored rankings. No paid placements. If we recommend a time or place, it's because we believe it's the right call — period.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-accent-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">4.</span> Affiliate Disclosure: Some hotel and flight search links on this site are affiliate links. If you book through them we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This never influences which month or region we recommend.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-accent-600 font-bold flex-shrink-0">5.</span> Corrections: If you find an error, <a href="/contact" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 underline">email us</a>. We'll fix it and note the correction. Accuracy matters more than pride.</li>
        </ul>
      </Callout>

      <!-- Why This Site Exists -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-50 to-white border border-accent-200 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-4">Why We Built This</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed">
          Most "best time to visit" guides give you a single sentence answer. Japan isn't a single place — it stretches from the tropical beaches of Okinawa to the powder-snow slopes of Hokkaido, spans four distinct seasons, and packs its busiest travel into a handful of impossible-to-book weeks. A one-size-fits-all answer doesn't work here.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 leading-relaxed mt-3">
          We built an interactive tool, not just an article, because we believe travel planning deserves better than generic advice. Pick your region. Pick your dates. Compare. Decide. We'll give you the data — the choice is yours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
